TSA-fortran bundle licensing
============================

The translated TSA source is derived from TSA 1.3.1, which is licensed under
GPL (>= 2). The bundled tseries Fortran dependency is licensed under either
GPL version 2 only or GPL version 3 only. Therefore this combined source bundle
may be redistributed under either GPL version 2 or GPL version 3, subject to
the notices and licenses of the individual components.

See LICENSE-GPL-2 and LICENSE-GPL-3 for the full license texts, and NOTICE for
component provenance. Each vendored dependency retains its own license files.
